    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hcl_ui_controls_hcl_mcm_scroll_acceleration_desc">
        <text>Clamps the Cursor step speed to mouse scroll wheel speed.\n[DEFAULT = 1.0] 1:1 Cursor to scroll wheel step speed\nEvery value increment increases cursor acceleration by 10%</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hcl_ui_controls_hcl_mcm_univ_modifier">
        <text>Universal Modifier Key</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hcl_ui_controls_hcl_mcm_univ_modifier_desc">
        <text>Rebind the Universal modifier key\n[MODIFIER + MOUSE LMB] = Field Strip weapon parts and attachments.\n[MODIFIER + MOUSE RMB] = Disassemble Item\n[MODIFIER + SCROLL WHEEL(UP/DOWN)] = Move the cursor along column (Y-Axis Movement)\n[MODIFIER + KEYBOARD NUMBER KEY (1-5)] = Number keys (1-5) maps to (6-0)</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hcl_ui_controls_hcl_mcm_jump_type">
        <text>Keyboard number key shortcut behavior</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_hcl_ui_controls_hcl_mcm_jump_type_desc">
        <text>Exact Row : Cursor jumps to the exact row shown in the Hover UI\nItem Kind : Cursor in Hover UI Jumps to the item row matching their kind (Weapons = 2, Ammo = 4)</text>
    </string>
